Code copied from other go-fast libraries
=========================================

What several go-fast libraries need is in go-fast-core and imported from
there: compound files (cfb), code pages (charset), the text conventions
of the shared model (clean), symbol fonts (symbol), list labels (label),
the display of text (hidden), VBA projects (vba) and number formats
(numfmt). Core's NOTICE has their sources. What is below is still a copy
here. All of it is by the same author and under the same MIT License.

  internal/warn,              from go-fast-ooxml (v0.1.1), adapted: the bounds
  internal/stored,            are this library's, the warning codes core's; internal/stored
  internal/unit,              puts macros only in the stored part; file.go keeps ooxml's
  file.go, cmd/gofastmsbin    reading of parts in order and in parallel.
  internal/grid               from go-fast-ooxml (v0.1.1): the stage of
                              internal/sml that turns a sheet's cells into
                              table blocks (regions.go, and the ordering and
                              naming of cells from sheet.go and sml.go), made
                              a package of its own.
  internal/ptg                from go-fast-ooxml (v0.1.1): internal/xlsb's
                              formula.go and functions.go, with the token
                              layouts of this format and of Excel 5/95 in
                              place of those of .xlsb; numbers written to
                              fifteen digits; functions kept by name
                              (_xlfn.) written as an .xlsx file writes them.
  api_snapshot_test.go        from go-fast-ooxml (v0.1.1): the test that holds
                              the exported declarations to testdata/api.txt.
  internal/chart              from go-fast-ooxml (v0.1.1): the table of a
                              chart's data and its blocks, from
                              internal/chart/chart.go.
  internal/doc/numbering.go   from go-fast-ooxml (v0.1.1): the counting and
                              formatting of list labels of
                              internal/wml/numbering.go; the definitions are
                              read from this format's list tables. The rules
                              by which a style's name makes a paragraph a
                              title, a quotation or code are its
                              internal/wml/styles.go's.
  internal/mtef               from go-fast-ooxml (v0.1.1): the rules of the
                              linear form of an equation (when a part is put
                              in parentheses, where a space ends a structure)
                              are its internal/omml's. The reading of MTEF is
                              written here, from the published description of
                              the format and from files.

Third-party data
================

The tables of symbol fonts and of code pages, which this library had
copies of, are go-fast-core's now (packages symbol and charset); core's
NOTICE names their sources and terms.


Test corpus
===========

The files of the test corpus are not part of this repository. testdata/corpus.json
lists each by URL and hash, with the licence it is under at its source;
testdata/fetch.py downloads them.
